explanation: Logs capture discrete events, metrics summarize behavior over time, and traces connect work across service boundaries. Structured logs and correlation IDs help investigate a request without exposing secrets or sensitive payloads. Observability should support actionable alerts rather than merely collecting data.
codeExample: logger.info("request_completed", extra={\n    "request_id": request_id,\n    "status_code": 200,\n    "duration_ms": elapsed_ms,\n})
