objective: Test positive and negative requests
objective: validate response structure
objective: verify authorization boundaries.
pitfall: Checking only status 200
pitfall: using production data
pitfall: ignoring pagination and error responses.
prerequisites: qa-pytest-unit
resource: Microsoft REST API Guidelines|https://github.com/microsoft/api-guidelines|guide
