id: llme-serving-safety
title: LLM Serving, Guardrails, and Observability
roadmapId: llm-engineer
type: standard
targetSubroadmap: 
difficulty: Advanced
estimatedMinutes: 65
summary: Operate LLM features with controlled latency, cost, privacy, and failure behavior.
explanation: Use streaming where useful, set timeouts and token budgets, apply rate limits, track provider errors, and record safe operational traces. Guardrails can reduce specific risks but should complement authorization, input/output validation, and adversarial testing.
