codeExample: 
objective: Write host tests for hardware-independent logic
objective: Use breakpoints or trace to inspect target behavior
objective: Test reset, timeout, and fault paths
pitfall: Testing only on the happy path
pitfall: Relying on logs that alter timing-sensitive behavior
